      "hash64": "D9594C1A6DDF620A",
      "text": "Amazing! Look at you, taking on a [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Terastallized[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\nopponent and winning, no problem![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
