      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0215_rival_13",
      "hash64": "3D1A2DB8D9FCDF0B",
      "text": "You’re so good with Pokémon battles, I forget\\nhow new you are to this stuff sometimes![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
